---
<Layout title="Free browser tools" description="Free tools by Charlie (chermdev) that run in your browser: Stripe fee, auto loan, mortgage, and compound interest calculators. Image and video compressors are next." image="tools"><section class="page-shell pt-12 pb-section"><p class="meta mb-5">Tools</p><h1 class="section-heading">Free tools that run in your browser.</h1><div class="mt-6 mb-14 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6"><p class="lead">No sign-up, and your inputs stay on your device. Each tool shows its assumptions and the math behind it.</p></div><ToolList /></section></Layout>
